{"id":"e084498f7e3f8113a557376a0afbd074cec5b824","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1231536","title":"除了刷 leetcode, 平时大家还会古法编程吗？","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"joeeey9303","excerpt":"程序员 - @joeeey9303 - 有时候就是改一行代码的配置文件，古法明显更快，但惯性还是会打开 codex 一通口喷","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Wrapper\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>有时候就是改一行代码的配置文件，古法明显更快，但惯性还是会打开 codex 一通口喷</p></div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/编程\"><li></li> 编程</a><a href=\"/tag/配置\"><li></li> 配置</a><a href=\"/tag/习惯\"><li></li> 习惯</a></P><p><span>18 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-08-03 13:03:37 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17928527\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3f22/feff/383743_normal.png?m=1778835129\" alt=\"YanSeven\" data-uid=\"383743\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/YanSeven\">YanSeven</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-02 16:00:41 +08:00\">23h 14m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我有时候想到我还有去找配置文件以及字段的位置，就想算了，让 Agent 去找去改吧。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17928556\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3d31/8385/456629_normal.png?m=1758896349\" alt=\"heimoshuiyu\" data-uid=\"456629\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/heimoshuiyu\">heimoshuiyu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-02 16:31:26 +08:00\">22h 43m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>有次改一行 api 配置，把 URL 中的 paas (platform as a service) 抄成了 pass, 排查了一个小时才发现问题。从那以后再简单的事情也会交给 agent 做</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17928557\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/6c2b/646b/621283_normal.png?m=1692511549\" alt=\"gpt5\" data-uid=\"621283\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/gpt5\">gpt5</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-02 16:35:11 +08:00\">22h 39m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>自从有了火车，我就不步行从北京去上海了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17928634\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/7b9b8602ba299021f24853ea9966b0fd?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"neilwong\" data-uid=\"104423\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/neilwong\">neilwong</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-02 17:29:33 +08:00\">21h 45m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>有一次小程序配 api,https:// 复制粘贴到时候粘贴成了 https:/// 导致 api 能调用但是一直提示未在域名白名单无法上线，人失误的概率真的比 AI 大多了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17928767\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/fc01/10cc/484954_normal.png?m=1754372644\" alt=\"moefishtang\" data-uid=\"484954\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/moefishtang\">moefishtang</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-02 19:47:43 +08:00\">19h 26m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>会的，除了改配置文件，AI 生成完有一些很容易排查的小问题也顺手修了（古法更快，AI 还得哼哧哼哧半天<br>这样也节约一些 token</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17928787\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/354a/c345/4046_normal.png?m=1331920250\" alt=\"edmond\" data-uid=\"4046\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/edmond\">edmond</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-02 20:16:52 +08:00\">18h 57m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>将来是用 token 编程最普遍了，反而“古法编程”会是一个很奢侈的行为。</p><p>类比：用电照明是最省，用蜡烛来照明更花钱了</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17928924\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4571/ffbc/265735_normal.png?m=1782441383\" alt=\"wu67\" data-uid=\"265735\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/wu67\">wu67</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-02 22:11:47 +08:00\">17h 2m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>忘记上一次打开 leetcode 是什么时候了.</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17929033\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4b6f/8ef1/391860_normal.png?m=1784041852\" alt=\"uiosun\" data-uid=\"391860\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/uiosun\">uiosun</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-03 00:11:30 +08:00\">15h 3m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/gpt5\">gpt5</a> +1 ，但是去门口超市买个酸奶，还是步行的哈哈哈</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17929446\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/5b36cf6907724c1357419e37926f99ab?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"l84\" data-uid=\"664263\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/l84\">l84</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-03 09:35:44 +08:00\">5h 38m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>tm 的我现在改个.env key 都用 LLM</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17929680\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/fcb2f9d15e718795078d58a674054610?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"noahliaszn\" data-uid=\"159995\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/noahliaszn\">noahliaszn</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-03 10:04:19 +08:00\">5h 10m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>AI 让我变懒了, 写个配置以前都是动手写的, 现在知道怎么写, 但是都就不想动手, 只想命令 LLM 操作</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17929687\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/1f31/8f31/252492_normal.png?m=1785465400\" alt=\"liushuang\" data-uid=\"252492\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/liushuang\">liushuang</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-03 10:04:40 +08:00\">5h 10m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>说实话改 .env 的时候打开 agent 等它启动的时间都够我手改完了… 但就是改不了这毛病</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17930104\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/c42a/7c8f/781786_normal.png?m=1772009323\" alt=\"niubi8\" data-uid=\"781786\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/niubi8\">niubi8</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-03 10:51:56 +08:00\">4h 22m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>已经好久好久没手写代码了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17930596\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3f00/c7b2/441995_normal.png?m=1762705741\" alt=\"yxc246800\" data-uid=\"441995\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>17</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yxc246800\">yxc246800</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-03 11:44:50 +08:00\">3h 29m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>leetcode 真还有必要刷吗，ai 分析算法需求比你又快又好，写算法也又快又好，你让 ai 给出思路，然后让 ai 顺着它的思路写算法，刷多久力扣能和 ai 平起平坐。<br>比如我的采样数据在跳，我让 ai 分析用什么算法滤波比较好，ai 给出几个选项，我让 ai 都实现一次，然后我再古法 review 一遍，古法调用</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n            </div></DIV>","content_text":"有时候就是改一行代码的配置文件，古法明显更快，但惯性还是会打开 codex 一通口喷 编程 配置 习惯18 replies • 2026-08-03 13:03:37 +08:00 1 YanSeven 23h 14m ago 我有时候想到我还有去找配置文件以及字段的位置，就想算了，让 Agent 去找去改吧。 3 heimoshuiyu 22h 43m ago 有次改一行 api 配置，把 URL 中的 paas (platform as a service) 抄成了 pass, 排查了一个小时才发现问题。从那以后再简单的事情也会交给 agent 做 4 gpt5 22h 39m ago 自从有了火车，我就不步行从北京去上海了。 5 neilwong 21h 45m ago 有一次小程序配 api,https:// 复制粘贴到时候粘贴成了 https:/// 导致 api 能调用但是一直提示未在域名白名单无法上线，人失误的概率真的比 AI 大多了 6 moefishtang 19h 26m ago 会的，除了改配置文件，AI 生成完有一些很容易排查的小问题也顺手修了（古法更快，AI 还得哼哧哼哧半天这样也节约一些 token 7 edmond 18h 57m ago 将来是用 token 编程最普遍了，反而“古法编程”会是一个很奢侈的行为。类比：用电照明是最省，用蜡烛来照明更花钱了 8 wu67 17h 2m ago 忘记上一次打开 leetcode 是什么时候了. 12 uiosun 15h 3m ago @gpt5 +1 ，但是去门口超市买个酸奶，还是步行的哈哈哈 13 l84 5h 38m ago tm 的我现在改个.env key 都用 LLM 14 noahliaszn 5h 10m ago AI 让我变懒了, 写个配置以前都是动手写的, 现在知道怎么写, 但是都就不想动手, 只想命令 LLM 操作 15 liushuang 5h 10m ago 说实话改 .env 的时候打开 agent 等它启动的时间都够我手改完了… 但就是改不了这毛病 16 niubi8 4h 22m ago 已经好久好久没手写代码了 17 yxc246800 3h 29m ago leetcode 真还有必要刷吗，ai 分析算法需求比你又快又好，写算法也又快又好，你让 ai 给出思路，然后让 ai 顺着它的思路写算法，刷多久力扣能和 ai 平起平坐。比如我的采样数据在跳，我让 ai 分析用什么算法滤波比较好，ai 给出几个选项，我让 ai 都实现一次，然后我再古法 review 一遍，古法调用","fetched_at":"2026-08-03T07:15:02.556Z","ok":true}